{"seq":9,"slug":"game-theory","title":"博弈论","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"博弈论-策略互动的数学框架\">博弈论：策略互动的数学框架</h1><h2 id=\"hub-定位\">Hub 定位</h2><p>本 hub 研究多个决策主体在相互影响的环境中如何做出最优选择。它的独特视角是：你的最优决策取决于别人的决策，而别人也在做同样的事——因此分析单位不是&quot;个体最优化&quot;，而是&quot;策略组合的均衡&quot;。四章内容层层递进：第一章建立语言（表示法与均衡概念），第二章用经典模型训练直觉（困境、协调、重复、演化），第三章引入信息不对称（贝叶斯博弈、信号传递、机制设计），第四章回到真实场景（拍卖、谈判、商业竞争）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>它回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的分工边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../microeconomics/\">微观经济学</a></td>\n<td>单个主体在给定的价格与预算约束下如何最优化</td>\n<td>微观经济学把他人行为当作环境参数；本 hub 中他人是会反策略回应的参与人，核心概念从&quot;最优&quot;换成&quot;均衡&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../behavioral-economics/\">行为经济学</a></td>\n<td>真实人如何系统性偏离理性假设</td>\n<td>本 hub 在完全理性框架内推演均衡结构；有限理性下的策略行为修正归行为经济学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../information-economics/\">信息经济学</a></td>\n<td>信息不对称如何扭曲市场结果与契约安排</td>\n<td>本 hub 提供其数学引擎（贝叶斯纳什均衡、信号传递与筛选、显示原理）；信息经济学侧重逆向选择的市场后果与契约应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../industrial-organization/\">产业组织</a></td>\n<td>企业间竞争、市场结构与反垄断</td>\n<td>产业组织把博弈论用作解释寡头定价、市场进入的工作母机并辅以实证；本 hub 仅在第四章取数个模型作应用示例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../market-design-mechanism-design/\">市场设计与机制设计</a></td>\n<td>如何设计规则让稀缺资源配到对的人手里</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲清机制设计的博弈论原理（激励相容、VCG、不可能定理）；该 hub 聚焦频谱拍卖、匹配市场等工程化落地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../experimental-economics/\">实验经济学</a></td>\n<td>理论预测在受控实验中是否成立</td>\n<td>本 hub 给出可检验的预测（如囚徒困境中的合作率衰减）；实验方法与行为数据检验归实验经济学</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话总结：<strong>本 hub 是这组 hub 共同的方法论底座</strong>——它不替代任何兄弟 hub 的具体问题，而是提供它们共用的均衡分析语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>本 hub 四章严格递进，每章在前一章概念上引入新维度，首次学习建议按顺序通读。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第一章「博弈基础」</strong>：标准式与扩展式表示 → 支配策略与纳什均衡 → 混合策略均衡 → 子博弈完美均衡。这是全部后续内容的语言和工具，不可跳过。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章「经典博弈模型」</strong>：囚徒困境 → 协调与懦夫博弈 → 重复博弈与合作 → 演化博弈论。从抽象定义走向解释力：合作为何涌现、承诺为何有价值。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章「信息与博弈」</strong>：不完全信息博弈与贝叶斯均衡 → 信号传递与筛选 → 机制设计。把&quot;我知道什么、对方知道我知道什么&quot;变成可计算的对象。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章「博弈论应用」</strong>：拍卖理论 → 谈判理论 → 商业应用。理论工具在真实场景中的检验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分人群推荐路线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>人群</th>\n<th>推荐路线</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>零基础通识读者</td>\n<td>第一章 1–2 篇 → 第二章全部 → 第四章商业应用</td>\n<td>先建立&quot;均衡&quot;直觉再回补技术细节；跳过混合策略的支撑集求解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济 / 金融专业学生</td>\n<td>第一至第四章全序</td>\n<td>完整链条是后续计量、产业组织、契约理论课程的先修基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工程 / AI 背景读者</td>\n<td>第一章（重点纳什均衡与扩展式）→ 第三章机制设计 → 第四章拍卖</td>\n<td>广告竞价、多智能体系统、机制设计直接对口；第二章可选读重复博弈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商业 / 政策从业者</td>\n<td>第二章囚徒困境与协调博弈 → 第四章商业应用与谈判</td>\n<td>快速拿到可用于分析价格战、平台竞争、议价的思维框架</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>数学</strong>：函数与不等式、基础概率（期望值、条件概率）、一元微积分（求导与极值，用于连续策略的古诺均衡和混合策略求解）。</li>\n<li><strong>经济学</strong>：了解效用最大化和市场均衡有帮助但非必需——本 hub 自带独立的分析框架，所有概念均从零定义。</li>\n<li><strong>不需要</strong>：测度论、不动点定理、拓扑学等高级工具。文中提到布劳威尔不动点定理时只使用其结论，不涉及证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../behavioral-economics/\">行为经济学</a> — 行为博弈论修正完全理性假设，研究有限理性下的策略行为</li>\n<li><a href=\"../information-economics/\">信息经济学</a> — 第三章的深化方向：信息不对称下的契约设计与激励理论</li>\n<li><a href=\"../industrial-organization/\">产业组织</a> — 寡头竞争、市场进入与企业战略的模型深化与实证</li>\n<li><a href=\"../market-design-mechanism-design/\">市场设计与机制设计</a> — 从机制设计原理到频谱拍卖与匹配市场的工程化落地</li>\n<li><a href=\"../experimental-economics/\">实验经济学</a> — 博弈论预测的实验室检验：合作、协调与讨价还价的真实行为</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"game-theory-basics","title":"博弈基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/game-theory-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"game-representation-and-classification","title":"博弈的表示与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/game-theory-basics/game-representation-and-classification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dominant-strategy-and-nash-equilibrium","title":"支配策略与纳什均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/game-theory-basics/dominant-strategy-and-nash-equilibrium"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mixed-strategy-equilibrium","title":"混合策略均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/game-theory-basics/mixed-strategy-equilibrium"},{"seq":4,"slug":"extensive-form-games","title":"扩展式博弈与逆向归纳","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/game-theory-basics/extensive-form-games"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"classic-game-models","title":"经典博弈模型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/classic-game-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prisoners-dilemma","title":"囚徒困境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/classic-game-models/prisoners-dilemma"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coordination-and-chicken-games","title":"协调博弈与懦夫博弈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/classic-game-models/coordination-and-chicken-games"},{"seq":3,"slug":"repeated-games-and-cooperation","title":"重复博弈与合作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/classic-game-models/repeated-games-and-cooperation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"evolutionary-game-theory","title":"演化博弈论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/classic-game-models/evolutionary-game-theory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-and-games","title":"信息与博弈","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/information-and-games","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"incomplete-information-games","title":"不完全信息博弈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/information-and-games/incomplete-information-games"},{"seq":2,"slug":"signaling-and-screening","title":"信号传递与筛选","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/information-and-games/signaling-and-screening"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mechanism-design","title":"机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/information-and-games/mechanism-design"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"game-theory-applications","title":"博弈论应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/game-theory-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"auction-theory","title":"拍卖理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/game-theory-applications/auction-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bargaining-theory","title":"谈判理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/game-theory-applications/bargaining-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"game-theory-in-business","title":"博弈论的商业应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/game-theory/game-theory-applications/game-theory-in-business"}]}]}